      "id": "claim_b0040495297f47dd891de59e822d088d",
      "statement": "Chrome is Manifest V3 with a module service-worker background, minimum_chrome_version 116, permissions activeTab/scripting/storage/tabs/downloads, and http/https host permissions granted at install time; Safari is Manifest V2 with browser_action and *://*/* declared as a required permission.",
